%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: ComposerDialogues_monteverdi_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 12cb1125e8a16c2499fca637b3f8bc00, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 2467484298437874
    m_Localized: The voice says one thing, the harmony another. What a madrigal of
      misunderstandings!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437875
    m_Localized: That vocal effect is wearing a mask. Bring the real voice onstage!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437876
    m_Localized: A dissonance should pierce the heart, not tickle the cable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437877
    m_Localized: Where is the gesture in the phrase? This declaims like an automatic
      door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437878
    m_Localized: The melody falls to its knees while the bass keeps mopping the floor!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437879
    m_Localized: So many doubled vocals... Is this a choir or a hall of mirrors?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437880
    m_Localized: The rhythm will not let the singer speak. Even servants interrupt
      less!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437881
    m_Localized: That entrance needs intention, not a smoke curtain with pitch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437882
    m_Localized: They dressed emotion in effects and gave it no role.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437883
    m_Localized: Basso continuo does not mean a bass that continually annoys!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437884
    m_Localized: That harmonic turn served the expression. I acknowledge it, irritating
      though it is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437885
    m_Localized: The voice made a convincing gesture. I made the gesture of losing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437886
    m_Localized: That dissonance knew when to yield. My indignation is still rehearsing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437887
    m_Localized: The bass let the melody declaim. Courtesy I did not expect.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437888
    m_Localized: There was theatre in that entrance. And I ended up backstage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437889
    m_Localized: I admit the voices conversed. They even agreed on how to defeat
      me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437890
    m_Localized: The effect highlighted emotion. It did not hide it. I must revise
      my complaint.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437891
    m_Localized: That pause said something. Right now I would rather say very little.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437892
    m_Localized: The phrase had dramatic direction. It led me to an undignified exit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437893
    m_Localized: The melody knew how to move us. Let the record show my grimace is
      expressive too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437894
    m_Localized: Curtain down! The artificial voice may remove its makeup.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437895
    m_Localized: Expression won. The effects can be extras.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437896
    m_Localized: The dissonance said nothing. Defeat was very eloquent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437897
    m_Localized: That bass has interrupted the aria for the last time!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437898
    m_Localized: 'A short tragedy: the melody went onstage without intention.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437899
    m_Localized: The doubled vocals may now share a single defeat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437900
    m_Localized: Victory! It takes no thirty filters to make a note speak.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437901
    m_Localized: Emotion failed to appear. I won by artistic default!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437902
    m_Localized: That ending asked for a dramatic gesture. I lowered the curtain
      on it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437903
    m_Localized: Applause for the well-spoken phrase! Noise already had enough of
      an audience.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
